<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Lusen via Teufelsloch and Himmelsleiter — Fredenbrücke–Teufelsloch–Himmelsleiter loop</name><desc>From Fredenbrücke in the Bavarian Forest, follow Martinsklause, Teufelsloch, Glasarche and the long Himmelsleiter stone staircase to Lusen’s granite-boulder summit. Return via Lusenschutzhaus, Waldhausreibe, Waldhäuser Ausblick and Martinsklause. Use snow-free conditions and sturdy footwear; check current seasonal restrictions, normally 1 May–14 November on relevant marked sections. Avoid strong winds and falling deadwood.

